    "detailed_description": "&quot;My Body Your Body \uff5e\u307e\u3044\u306b\u3061\u7537\u5973\u5165\u308c\u66ff\u308f\u308a\u751f\u6d3b\uff01\uff1f\uff5e&quot; is a novel game where the protagonist and three heroines find themselves under a curse that swaps their bodies. As they navigate everyday activities like changing clothes and bathing, they search for a way to reverse the situation in this gender-swapping story.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe protagonist Taichi, who has no friends, was despairing about forming a group for the field<br />\r\nSaki Matsudo, who couldn't let him be alone, decided to form a group with Taichi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMariko Honjo reads alone in the corner of the classroom.<br />\r\nEri Sasazuka is busy playing around on her by herself.<br />\r\nSaki called out to the other loners like Taichi. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis hodgepodge group of individuals came together for the fieldtrip,<br />\r\nwhich ended with them breaking a &quot;cursed pot&quot; while fooling around inside the museum...<br />\r\nTaichi goes to apologize to the staff, only to be told there was no such exhibit, and returns home. He reflects on the strange day and falls asleep.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe next day-<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;What is going on?!?!&quot;<br />\r\nTaichi's shout turned into Saki's voice and resounded throughout the Matsudo household...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery day these four people's bodies are randomly swapped by a cursed pot!?<br />\r\nWill this ragtag team be able to safely return to their original bodies...?",
